<title>GERMANY: German state of North Rhine-Westphalia details CPI.</title>
<headline>German state of North Rhine-Westphalia details CPI.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Office in the west German state of North Rhine-Westphalia gave the following breakdown of its September cost of living data :</p>
<p>						 Percentage change</p>
<p> Index/component			   mth/mth   yr/yr    Index</p>
<p> Overall price index		     - 0.1     + 1.5    114.0</p>
<p> Prices exc heating oil, fuel	  - 0.2     + 1.2    113.9</p>
<p> Prices exc seasonal goods	     unch	+ 1.6    114.7</p>
<p> Prices exc services and repairs     + 0.1     + 1.4    112.3</p>
<p> Rents					 + 0.2     + 3.1    124.7</p>
<p> Household energy			  + 1.8     - 2.2     98.3</p>
<p> Personal goods, services and other  - 3.4     + 0.7    123.6</p>
<p> Transport and communications	  + 0.1     + 1.8    114.4</p>
<p> Furniture and other household goods + 0.1     + 0.9    110.9</p>
<p> Foodstuffs, drinks, tobacco	   - 0.3     + 1.0    108.8</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes			   + 0.3     + 1.0    112.0</p>
<p> Health and personal care items	+ 0.1     + 3.0    114.2</p>
<p> Education, entertainment, leisure   + 0.6     + 1.1    110.1</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
